README.md
# Policy Parser API

The Policy Parser converts institutional policy documents into structured, machine-readable JSON compatible with the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

The parser enables institutional policies to become searchable, analyzable, interoperable, and usable by AI systems.

---

## Features

- Markdown policy parsing
- PDF policy extraction (future)
- JSON normalization
- Metadata extraction
- Governance primitive identification
- Policy tagging
- Capability classification
- Institutional graph integration

---

## Workflow

```
Policy Document

↓

Parser

↓

Section Extraction

↓

Metadata Extraction

↓

Governance Classification

↓

JSON Output

↓

Knowledge Graph
```

---

## Endpoints

POST /parse

POST /validate

GET /schema

GET /health
